Ragas allows you to define custom metrics tailored to your specific application needs using simple decorators. For example, a custom metric can be defined as follows:
```python
from ragas.metrics import CustomMetric

class UserEngagement(CustomMetric):
    def compute(self, response, user_input):
        # Custom logic for computing engagement
        return len(response) * 2 / len(user_input)
```
